reviewer_concerns.value:
The reviewers initially raised several key concerns:

(1) insufficient experimental validation across newer and more diverse LVLMs and benchmarks;

(2) baseline scope focused too narrowly on contrastive decoding methods, with limited positioning against other inference time mitigation categories;

(3) unclear impact of the Residual Free Mechanism on general multimodal abilities and generation richness;

(4) sensitivity to hyperparameters such as the number of selected heads, and incomplete method and reporting details including writing and figure readability.
